# Redirect-only Netlify site for the bare domain, used only if www moves to Cloudflare Pages (docs/HOSTING.md
# on the main branch). Domain-scoped, so a request that still reaches Netlify for www during DNS propagation
# is not redirected to itself.
https://clarkesystemsgroup.com/*   https://www.clarkesystemsgroup.com/:splat   301!
http://clarkesystemsgroup.com/*    https://www.clarkesystemsgroup.com/:splat   301!
